  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業發展趨勢與投資分析",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY DEVELOPMENT TRENDS AND INVESTMENT ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標在協助學生了解產業知識，包括全球產業趨勢脈動，掌握國際市場發展方向。並培養學生對產業前景的預測能力，包括應用資料收集調查、判讀分析或預測之基本技巧，將資訊轉化為分析報告，進而形成企業營運策略。培養學生產業管理能力，同時熟悉企業經營基本要件與外部資源整合重點。最後培養學生未來對產業的貢獻，透過整合成果展現，參考多元案例思考未來創新轉型策略方向於幫助學生在未來的職業生涯中更加順利地融入工作環境。",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of this course is to help students understand industry knowledge, including the pulse of global industry trends, and grasp the development direction of the international market. It also cultivates students' ability to predict industry prospects, including applying basic skills of data collection and investigation, interpretation and analysis or prediction, and transforming information into analysis reports to form corporate operating strategies. Cultivate students' industrial management capabilities while becoming familiar with the basic elements of business operations and the key points of integrating external resources. Finally, students are trained to contribute to the industry in the future. Through the integration of results display and reference to multiple cases, they can think about future innovation and transformation strategies to help students integrate into the work environment more smoothly in their future careers.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
